<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ms">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bidang Akidah - Pendidikan Islam Tahun 3</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
    .arabic-font { font-family: 'Amiri', serif; direction: rtl; }
    @media print {
      @page { size: A4 portrait; margin: 10mm; }
      body { background-color: #ffffff !important; color: #000000 !important; font-size: 10pt; }
      .no-print { display: none !important; }
      .print-only { display: block !important; }
    }
    @media screen { .print-only { display: none; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-amber-50/40 text-slate-800 min-h-screen antialiased">
  <div class="no-print max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 md:py-10 space-y-8">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="index.html" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white hover:bg-slate-100 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 shadow-xs">
        <span>⬅️</span><span>Kembali ke Menu Bidang</span>
      </a>
      <button onclick="window.print()" class="bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white px-4 py-2.5 rounded-2xl font-bold text-xs shadow-md">
        Cetak Lembaran A4 (PDF)
      </button>
    </div>

    <header class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-teal-100">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-teal-100 text-teal-800 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">
        <span>🏛️ BIDANG AKIDAH</span> • <span>TAHUN 3</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-2">Allah Al-'Alim & Al-Hakim</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 italic">Allah The All-Knowing & The All-Wise</p>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 shadow-sm border border-teal-100 space-y-4">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900">Nota WAGBA Akidah (Buku Teks)</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 text-xs font-bold">
        <button onclick="setTab(1)" id="b-1" class="p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-teal-50 border-teal-500">1. Al-'Alim</button>
        <button onclick="setTab(2)" id="b-2" class="p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-white border-slate-200">2. Al-Hakim</button>
        <button onclick="setTab(3)" id="b-3" class="p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-white border-slate-200">3. Dalil Naqli</button>
        <button onclick="setTab(4)" id="b-4" class="p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-white border-slate-200">4. Kesan Beriman</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="c-1" class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-pink-200 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-pink-700 uppercase">Erti Al-'Alim</span>
      <p class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Al-'Alim bererti Maha Mengetahui.</p>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">"Nama Allah Al-'Alim bermaksud Allah Maha Mengetahui setiap sesuatu secara terperinci."</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic">Tiada suatu pun yang tersembunyi daripada pengetahuan Allah SWT.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="c-2" class="hidden bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-blue-200 space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 uppercase">Erti Al-Hakim</span>
      <p class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">Al-Hakim bererti Maha Bijaksana.</p>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">"Nama Allah Al-Hakim bermaksud Allah Maha Bijaksana mencipta dan mentadbir alam."</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 italic">Setiap ciptaan-Nya mengandungi hikmah, faedah dan tujuan.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="c-3" class="hidden bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-teal-200 text-center space-y-3">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-teal-800 uppercase">Dalil Naqli (Surah An-Nisa': 26)</span>
      <p class="arabic-font text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-teal-950">وَاللَّهُ عَلِيمٌ حَكِيمٌ ﴿٢٦﴾</p>
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">"Sesungguhnya Allah Maha Mengetahui lagi Maha Bijaksana."</p>
    </div>

    <div id="c-4" class="hidden bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-teal-200 space-y-4">
      <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900">4 Kesan Beriman Kepada Al-'Alim & Al-Hakim (Buku Teks):</h4>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
        <div class="p-4 bg-pink-50 rounded-2xl border space-y-1">
          <div class="font-extrabold text-pink-800">1. Mentaati Perintah Allah SWT</div>
          <div>• Melipatgandakan amalan | • Menjauhi maksiat</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border space-y-1">
          <div class="font-extrabold text-amber-800">2. Berusaha Meningkatkan Ilmu</div>
          <div>• Belajar ilmu bermanfaat | • Tekun & bersungguh-sungguh</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-teal-50 rounded-2xl border space-y-1">
          <div class="font-extrabold text-teal-800">3. Mensyukuri Nikmat Allah SWT</div>
          <div>• Guna nikmat sebaik-baiknya | • Memelihara alam</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-2xl border space-y-1">
          <div class="font-extrabold text-blue-800">4. Reda Dengan Ketentuan Allah SWT</div>
          <div>• Bersangka baik | • Sabar dengan ujian</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function setTab(id) {
      for(let i=1; i<=4; i++){
        document.getElementById('c-'+i).classList.add('hidden');
        document.getElementById('b-'+i).className = "p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-white border-slate-200";
      }
      document.getElementById('c-'+id).classList.remove('hidden');
      document.getElementById('b-'+id).className = "p-3 rounded-2xl border-2 bg-teal-50 border-teal-500";
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
